# A projection is KDL (doc/dsl.md §3.1), so GitHub should colour it as KDL rather than as
# plain text. This matters more here than it would elsewhere: doc/flat-first.md's argument is
# that office documents belong in git, and a document nobody can read in a pull request is a
# document that is only technically there.
*.grind linguist-language=KDL
